                <pb facs="0301" n="189" sameAs="frus:frus1910/pg189"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 21891/2.</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Chilean Minister to the Secretary of
                    State.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Translation.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Chilean Legation</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                            >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1910-01-27"><hi rendition="#italic">January 27,
                        1910</hi></date>.</dateline>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">No. 2.]</seg></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: As is known to your excellency, Chile will
                    celebrate in September next the first centennial of its independence, and on
                    that occasion my Government has instructed me to invite your excellency’s
                    Government to be represented at the celebration by a special envoy or
                    delegation, a military detachment, or a naval division.</p>
                <p>My Government is confident that your excellency will favorably receive this
                    invitation and trusts that the manner in which your excellency’s Government will
                    be represented in one or more of the forms above indicated will effectively
                    contribute to the strengthening of the relations between the two countries.</p>
                <p>In extending the foregoing invitation to your excellency I fulfill the pleasant
                    duty of putting on record and at the same time thanking your excellency for the
                    amiable manner in which you received the intimations I ventured to make orally
                    by way of introducing the present invitation.</p>
                <p>I renew, etc.,</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Anibal Cruz.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
